three.js, world-atlas and TopoJSON
----------------------------------
Motion graphics' pages may use three.js 0.186.1 (https://threejs.org,
Copyright 2010-2026 three.js authors, MIT License), bundled into one script
from the npm package by scripts/vendor-motion.ts; a world map from
world-atlas 2.0.2 (https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas, Copyright
2013-2019 Michael Bostock, ISC License), whose data is Natural Earth's
1:50m countries (https://www.naturalearthdata.com, public domain); and
topojson-client 3.1.0 (https://github.com/topojson/topojson-client,
Copyright 2019 Mike Bostock, ISC License). Each is inlined only into a page
that uses it.

